{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":6},"Vaurien","Après cinq ans d’études supérieures, Red est toujours à la recherche d’un travail et lutte chaque jour contre l’exclusion. Lentement, il s’éloigne d’Anna, l’amour de sa vie. Suite à une lettre lui signifiant sa radiation, il se rend à l’Agence pour l’Emploi, où on lui refuse un rendez-vous. N’ayant plus rien à perdre, il prend alors en otage le personnel et le public. Comme un ultime appel à l'aide, il est décidé à sauver ce qu’il lui reste de dignité.",[4,5],"high rank employment","state institutions",{"type":7,"id":8,"slug":9,"title":10,"release":12,"filmType":16,"directors":17,"genre":26,"media":28,"synopsis":31,"production":32,"characters":35,"roles":36,"awards":62,"tags":3},"Film","FR2018_145","fr2018-145-vaurien",{"native":1,"english":11},"",{"type":13,"date":14,"year":15},"Theatrical release","2018-09-19",2018,"Fiction film",[18],{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":25},"Mehdi Senoussi","mehdi-senoussi",1984,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[27],"Drama",{"posterUrl":29,"trailerUrl":30},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/216/247/194520/format_page/vaurien.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ATKC9LmWcIY",{"native":2,"english":11},[33],{"country":24,"share":34},"Majority coproducer",[],[37,44,51,55],{"person":38,"role":43},{"id":39,"slug":40,"name":39,"birthYear":22,"deathYear":22,"gender":41,"nationality":24,"awards":42},"Annie Mercier","annie-mercier","Female identifying",[],"Minor actor/Cameo",{"person":45,"role":43},{"id":46,"slug":47,"name":46,"birthYear":48,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":49,"awards":50},"Carlo Brandt","carlo-brandt",1954,"Switzerland",[],{"person":52,"role":54},{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":53},[],"Director of the film",{"person":56,"role":43},{"id":57,"slug":58,"name":57,"birthYear":59,"deathYear"